WEBVTT

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.580
Thanks for coming shopping with me.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:28.000
I found some really cute stickers.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:29.290
For replies to your fan letters?

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:30.290
Yup!

00:00:31.120 --> 00:00:32.120
What's up?

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:35.330
I was just remembering
Yumeri from the other day.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.120
Yeah, she seemed really happy.

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:45.370
Yeah.

00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:49.660
I think it's great that everyone
works so hard to become the center.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:51.540
I...

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:54.160
You don't want to be the center?

00:00:54.160 --> 00:00:57.580
I'd love to see you as the center, Sorane.

00:00:58.750 --> 00:01:01.620
I respect you, Reo.

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:05.700
And my ideal idol is always going to be you.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:06.700
So...

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:12.370
You have to be the center, no matter what.

00:02:54.790 --> 00:02:56.910
Reo!

00:02:56.910 --> 00:02:59.250
They perform here every week.

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:01.450
Maybe they're idols.

00:03:01.450 --> 00:03:02.450
Idols?

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:06.620
You mean you can be idols when
you only have that many in a crowd?

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:11.040
Right? Not to mention you're
cuter than they are, Sorane.

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:13.000
That's not true.

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.370
Reo!

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:20.160
Those girls are definitely cuter than me.

00:03:20.160 --> 00:03:21.870
Are you interested?

00:03:21.870 --> 00:03:24.660
I could never do something like that.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:31.080
Something you have to work so hard to become...

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:38.790
So for our next match, I decided to pair
with someone else for doubles.

00:03:38.790 --> 00:03:41.370
Huh? But why?

00:03:41.370 --> 00:03:43.540
I mean, just because, I guess?

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:47.950
I just figured I didn't have
to pair with you, Sorane.

00:03:47.950 --> 00:03:48.950
Oh...

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:55.410
So it doesn't have to be me...

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:00.500
See?

00:04:00.500 --> 00:04:03.500
"Okayama Station Shopping District"
It's impossible... It's impossible
to just think that one person is special.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:06.250
It's impossible... It's impossible
to just think that one person is special.

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:20.660
"You Were My Everything"

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:21.830
"Kasai Seminar" "ChamJam Agency"

00:04:21.830 --> 00:04:24.370
Girls, do you have a sec?

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:31.160
She'll be joining your lessons starting today.
This is Miss Matsuyama.

00:04:31.160 --> 00:04:33.410
Hello, I'm Yumeri.

00:04:33.410 --> 00:04:35.750
I'm Maki. Nice to meet you.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:37.330
It's a pleasure to meet you.

00:04:37.330 --> 00:04:39.000
Um, I--

00:04:40.160 --> 00:04:42.910
It's so nice to meet you! I'm Reo Igarashi!

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:47.410
I'm Matsuyama.

00:04:47.410 --> 00:04:51.200
Um... I've seen you perform a number of times.

00:04:51.200 --> 00:04:52.620
You mean me?

00:04:52.620 --> 00:04:54.080
The concerts in the shopping district.

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:57.290
Oh! From my old group.

00:04:57.290 --> 00:05:01.660
They ended up breaking up,
so Cham scooped me up.

00:05:01.660 --> 00:05:04.250
I've never danced before,

00:05:04.250 --> 00:05:05.250
or sung...

00:05:06.700 --> 00:05:08.750
My aunt sent in an application
for me without telling me.

00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:13.120
But you came this far with
your own two feet, right?

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:17.290
You'll be fine! I mean, even I can do this.

00:05:17.290 --> 00:05:19.370
Yeah, but you're...

00:05:19.370 --> 00:05:24.000
Even I had some fans who kept cheering me on.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:27.290
So I realized that idols aren't all about looks!

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:29.540
And I worked even harder on my dancing.

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:33.700
She has no idea how beautiful she is!

00:05:36.830 --> 00:05:38.700
You're super cute, Sorane.

00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:40.500
Once you put in some time,
you'll be the center immediately.

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:44.500
Huh? Did I tell you my name?

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:48.540
I wanted to become friends immediately,
so I already looked stuff up about you!

00:06:05.450 --> 00:06:07.200
This part's really hard.

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:09.080
Yeah, the part right before the last hook.

00:06:09.080 --> 00:06:11.870
It's a bit of a tongue twister,
and the lyrics keep changing a little,

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:13.200
so it's hard to memorize.

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:14.160
So with that part,

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:16.910
if you change the place you
take a breath, it'll be easier to sing.

00:06:16.910 --> 00:06:18.950
For you, Sorane,

00:06:18.950 --> 00:06:21.870
if you take small breaths here and here,

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:24.700
I think it'll make it easier to sing the hook.

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:28.330
We can definitely tell you've
been an idol for a while.

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:32.750
The more you sing the more your throat
and stomach muscles get used to it.

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:35.370
You can do anything, Reo.

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:40.290
That's not true. I mean, I try to seem
like I can, but that's about it.

00:06:46.330 --> 00:06:48.450
Nice to meet you. I'm Aya Yokota.

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:51.080
I'm going to take the number one spot!

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:52.450
You totally should!

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:54.080
No fair, Aya-<i>chin</i>!

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:54.870
Huh?

00:06:54.870 --> 00:06:56.790
Yuka's gonna take the number one spot, too!

00:06:56.790 --> 00:06:59.040
Who the heck are you? I don't know you.

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:00.950
I told you! I'm Yuka!

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:04.040
Um...

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:06.120
I'm Maina Ichii.

00:07:06.120 --> 00:07:09.790
I know how I seem,
but I've always admired idols...

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:10.790
Maina!

00:07:12.870 --> 00:07:13.750
You're so cute!

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:14.580
Huh?!

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:17.750
No, I'm pretty sure I'm not...

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:20.750
And I think I'm way cuter!

00:07:20.750 --> 00:07:22.330
Jeez, you're annoying, Yuka.

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.120
Just a little.

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:30.160
And now we have seven.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:31.160
Yeah.

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:35.870
This is ChamJam's first concert!

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:37.330
Here we go!

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:38.330
Yeah!

00:07:40.620 --> 00:07:43.580
Nice to meet you. We're ChamJam!

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:58.290
I mean, I figured there
wouldn't be that many but...

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:02.250
Don't worry.
We're going to fill up that plaza soon.

00:08:02.250 --> 00:08:03.750
Huh?

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:06.790
I'm pretty sure we can with the seven of us.

00:08:06.790 --> 00:08:08.080
You think so?

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:10.580
Hey, not just the plaza.

00:08:10.580 --> 00:08:12.120
Then I wonder where else.

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:13.660
Maybe a symphony?

00:08:13.660 --> 00:08:16.200
Maybe city hall?

00:08:16.200 --> 00:08:19.830
City hall's pretty big, you know?

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:23.040
Yeah... Probably not happening.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:29.250
The Budokan.

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:37.040
Let's go to the Budokan.

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:44.540
Reo must be worried...

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:47.290
...because her last group broke up.

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:51.620
I've been by her side for
so long that I understand.

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:03.250
Holy crap! Yeah, I can't answer
a single question! And we're done.

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:04.700
Wait, wait, wait.

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:07.120
You came here because you wanted
help with your homework, right?

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:09.200
If you don't want to, you should go home.

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:11.290
--Stare...
--What?

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:12.910
You fiend with a bob.

00:09:12.910 --> 00:09:15.540
Such vocabulary you'd never expect from an idol.

00:09:15.540 --> 00:09:17.750
What's an idol supposed to be like anyway?

00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:20.080
Huh? Well...

00:09:20.080 --> 00:09:22.080
What's an idol supposed to be like?

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:24.250
Well, if anything...

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:28.950
If you're just going to sleep, go home!

00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:34.790
Eripiyo's holding an eggplant!
She's switching to a Yumeri stan.

00:09:34.790 --> 00:09:39.500
Eripiyo's eating the guardrail!
She must be switching to a Yuka stan!

00:09:39.500 --> 00:09:43.620
Eripiyo's growing cherry blossoms!
She must be switching to a Reo stan!

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:45.330
Please don't!

00:09:45.330 --> 00:09:47.200
And I wish you guys would stop, too!

00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:48.950
I'm not switching!

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:51.330
What's with you, member color patrol squad?

00:09:51.330 --> 00:09:53.950
They sure are a pain.

00:09:55.290 --> 00:09:57.910
Blue! Sorane's color!

00:09:57.910 --> 00:10:00.580
Pot, meet kettle.

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:03.660
I just keep buying more and more blue things.

00:10:04.370 --> 00:10:05.830
"Aonori Sashimi Konjac"
Oh, here.

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:09.200
"Wake"
I bought these back home in Wake,

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:10.540
but please have some.

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:11.410
Thank you.

00:10:11.410 --> 00:10:13.000
Thanks...

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:14.000
The heck is this anyway?

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:16.370
Aonori sashimi konjac.

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:19.540
It's blue... so I just kept
buying more and more.

00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:23.000
Though, I mean... This is technically green.

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:24.000
Hello!

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:28.080
Say, your clothes...

00:10:28.080 --> 00:10:30.750
Were you thinking of my color
when you picked them?

00:10:30.750 --> 00:10:33.500
Wait, how could you tell?

00:10:33.500 --> 00:10:39.120
Well, duh. You picked that outfit
out just for me, right?

00:10:39.120 --> 00:10:40.410
Is what she told me.

00:10:40.410 --> 00:10:41.660
Damn it!

00:10:41.660 --> 00:10:46.200
Wait right there! I'll show you just how
adorably cold Maina can act towards me!

00:10:51.000 --> 00:10:52.250
I...

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:55.750
I always think of you when I eat salmon!

00:10:55.750 --> 00:10:57.660
Huh? Why, though?

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:04.200
Um... Thank you for the <i>kibi dango</i>.

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:05.580
Oh, you got them!

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:08.330
Thank goodness! Did you eat them?

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:10.580
Of course not!

00:11:10.580 --> 00:11:13.120
Huh? But why, though?

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:14.750
It'd be such a waste...

00:11:16.540 --> 00:11:20.410
Eripiyo-<i>san</i>'s got something green...

00:11:20.410 --> 00:11:23.330
Green is Aya's color!

00:11:24.120 --> 00:11:26.040
She's switching on me!

00:11:30.500 --> 00:11:33.950
She seemed to zone out
when I talked to her about salmon.

00:11:33.950 --> 00:11:39.290
Well, duh. You just get some
privileges for being a girl.

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:44.330
More importantly, isn't the newly
designed merch going on sale soon?

00:11:44.330 --> 00:11:45.910
Oh, that's right.

00:11:45.910 --> 00:11:49.040
I'm pretty sure the info was on Twitter.

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:05.450
What just happened?!

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:07.580
Motoi just died!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.910
There was a sighting...

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:14.700
Supposedly Sorane was seen
walking with some guy...

00:12:14.700 --> 00:12:16.040
Erf.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:17.250
Wha--?

00:12:17.250 --> 00:12:20.410
What?!

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:26.370
Idol <i>wotas </i>have the desire
to become idols themselves

00:12:26.370 --> 00:12:29.000
in order to get closer to their faves.

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:33.330
But if that happens, they won't be able
to see them as idols anymore.

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:37.120
Exactly! I've been struggling with that
for almost a year myself!

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:41.580
Oh, don't worry. You two will never be idols.

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:44.910
More importantly, don't act like
the grave situation that came to light

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:46.790
a couple of minutes ago never happened!

00:12:46.790 --> 00:12:49.500
Have a little more interest
in other people's faves!

00:12:49.500 --> 00:12:51.290
I couldn't care less about other people's faves.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:53.660
Yeah... I have absolutely no interest.

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:57.750
No way! This is a huge deal!

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:00.160
But I mean... Sorane's in the tennis club.

00:13:03.160 --> 00:13:04.790
Curse you, tennis club!

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:12.000
To be completely honest,
I don't think I can come here anymore.

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:15.410
Looking up your own name?

00:13:15.410 --> 00:13:19.250
No. I was just looking up
what it takes to raise a hamster.

00:13:21.290 --> 00:13:22.950
Uh...

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:25.790
What's so wrong with the tennis club?

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:30.870
This isn't good.
There's been a supposed sighting of me.

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:33.870
They're saying that they
saw me with a guy last week.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:34.910
Ah...

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:39.620
It wasn't me though! I was helping out
Yuka with her homework that day!

00:13:39.620 --> 00:13:42.040
I don't want people to get
stuck with this wrong idea

00:13:42.040 --> 00:13:47.500
so I was hoping Yuka could tell everyone
she was with me at tomorrow's show...

00:13:47.500 --> 00:13:50.120
But she says she doesn't remember!

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:53.950
Really? Yeah, not happening. I could never lie!

00:13:53.950 --> 00:13:55.290
Ugh!

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:57.540
You're way too worried about your fans.

00:13:57.540 --> 00:14:00.200
I've never even looked up my name before.

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:02.290
You're way too lax about this, Maki.

00:14:02.290 --> 00:14:04.700
I don't personally care, really.

00:14:04.700 --> 00:14:07.410
I'm not doing anything that
I'm afraid to be seen doing.

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:12.950
But... I only have Cham.

00:14:12.950 --> 00:14:17.000
Look! We got samples of our new merch!

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:18.750
Isn't it cute?

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:21.000
Hey, did you see the news on the internet?

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.330
Maki!

00:14:22.330 --> 00:14:23.330
Yeah...

00:14:27.500 --> 00:14:29.620
You're an idol, Sorane.

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:32.910
You'd never do anything out of character.

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:37.910
You can keep going tomorrow
like nothing ever happened.

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:40.290
If something comes up, I'll protect you.

00:14:43.250 --> 00:14:45.950
Yeah... it's definitely Reo.

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:53.450
You know... There are so many
different kinds of <i>otaku</i>.

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:55.620
Are you talking about Motoi?

00:14:55.620 --> 00:15:00.000
Well, yes, and it's not rare for guys
to fall in love with their faves.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:03.870
I never realized it because
I was always by myself.

00:15:03.870 --> 00:15:06.250
So wait. Are we not doing that thing?

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:07.870
Wait, wait! I'm going right now!

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:13.700
"A group photo with Momotaro and Reo"
Wow this pastime that costs absolutely no money is great!

00:15:14.790 --> 00:15:17.540
Taking similar selfies
from all their blog posts!

00:15:18.160 --> 00:15:21.580
Well, I mean, we're literally just taking
selfies in the exact same places.

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:26.500
We're doing the exact same poses...

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:29.450
So why do our photos look so much worse?

00:15:29.450 --> 00:15:31.540
You two sure are carefree.

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:34.580
Motoi! You came after all!

00:15:34.580 --> 00:15:37.830
Yes. I thought I'd make this my last visit.

00:15:39.160 --> 00:15:41.910
Sorane was my hope.

00:15:41.910 --> 00:15:44.410
She was all that I had...

00:15:44.410 --> 00:15:47.620
But apparently, she doesn't need me.

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:50.950
Then there's no point in me coming here anymore.

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:53.450
Could you sum all that up in a haiku?

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:59.750
My dear Sorane, you were my one
and only, we were meant to be.

00:15:59.750 --> 00:16:00.830
That's deep, man.

00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:14.250
Did you see that, Motoi?

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:16.160
Sorane just gave you a direct response!

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:19.290
I'm not that simple-minded, you know?

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:25.200
The hell you aren't.

00:16:25.200 --> 00:16:27.750
Sorane's amazing.

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:29.700
Yeah...

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:34.040
I need to shape up!

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:37.370
I'm going to support you from now on, okay?

00:16:37.370 --> 00:16:38.660
So cute!

00:16:38.660 --> 00:16:40.540
I'm going to follow you for life!

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:43.120
"Maina"
I expressed how I felt with this decorative candy!

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:49.620
I started to take for granted
that Eripiyo loves me.

00:16:49.620 --> 00:16:54.160
Of course, Eripiyo's going to stray
away if I don't do something!

00:16:58.330 --> 00:17:01.040
Please reach Eripiyo!

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:02.040
Take that!

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:07.870
She's not even looking!

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:12.410
Eripiyo's not even watching me!

00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:17.580
Can I get ten of Sorane's?

00:17:17.580 --> 00:17:19.750
Ah, so he dove right back into the swamp.

00:17:19.750 --> 00:17:21.290
I should follow his lead.

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:23.910
I need 20 copies of Reo's.

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:26.370
I need to make up for going
to the maid café the other day...

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:32.200
I want to support her, too. I'll die if I don't.

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:34.660
I want to spend all my money on her...

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:39.040
Let me spend money!

00:17:39.040 --> 00:17:41.870
Oh, no! Eripiyo's turned into
the take my money monster!

00:17:41.870 --> 00:17:45.000
Let me support! Let me spend money!

00:17:45.000 --> 00:17:47.290
Snap out of it!

00:17:47.290 --> 00:17:49.910
You can't just focus on buying merch!

00:17:49.910 --> 00:17:53.080
The most important thing is your
desire to support your fave!

00:17:54.750 --> 00:17:57.910
I'd have no problems in life if all Maina
needed to get popular was just my support.

00:17:57.910 --> 00:18:00.200
Crap! She just made complete sense!

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:04.500
But it's true that our sentiment is important!

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:06.500
Thanks, Kumasa!

00:18:09.120 --> 00:18:10.950
One, please!

00:18:10.950 --> 00:18:12.950
She only has one again today...

00:18:12.950 --> 00:18:17.450
What am I going to do if Eripiyo
really does switch faves?

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:20.250
What if she strays away from me?

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:27.660
I'm gonna play a game where I tell you everything I'm
feeling within five seconds before we're ripped apart!

00:18:27.660 --> 00:18:28.660
Huh?

00:18:29.160 --> 00:18:31.750
Maina, I love your face!
I love your dance and you're so gentle!

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:33.370
I love how you always do your best!

00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:36.500
I want to continue supporting you forever--
that's my true happiness.

00:18:36.500 --> 00:18:38.410
Just you being alive makes me happy.

00:18:38.410 --> 00:18:40.540
Just living in the same world
as you makes me happy.

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:42.450
I love you! I love you, Maina!

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:44.870
Five seconds! How was that?!

00:18:44.870 --> 00:18:48.790
Th-Thank you very much...

00:18:48.790 --> 00:18:51.910
Maina, I just wasn't sure if
you knew that already,

00:18:51.910 --> 00:18:53.750
so maybe I hadn't told you before.

00:18:53.750 --> 00:18:55.950
I-I got it now...

00:18:57.870 --> 00:19:01.910
Okay, we'll be starting Reo,
Sorane, and Yumeri very soon.

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:04.250
Hi! So you came!

00:19:04.250 --> 00:19:06.250
--Yeah.
--That's so sweet! Thank you very much.

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:07.410
Well, see you again.

00:19:07.410 --> 00:19:08.830
Yeah! See you soon.

00:19:11.450 --> 00:19:12.910
Ten for Sorane.

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:16.700
Motoi!

00:19:18.450 --> 00:19:19.950
Thank you!

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:21.330
You remembered my name?

00:19:21.330 --> 00:19:23.330
You gave me a letter the other day.

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:24.910
I knew who sent it immediately!

00:19:24.910 --> 00:19:28.830
But to think you actually remembered me...

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:36.540
I told you. I love people
who are faithful to me.

00:19:36.540 --> 00:19:39.290
I hope you continue to love me even more.

00:19:41.620 --> 00:19:42.620
Of course!

00:19:47.950 --> 00:19:52.910
In the end, you just fall for all
the people who say they love you.

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:55.450
It's different from a
romantic relationship though.

00:19:59.330 --> 00:20:01.910
Sorane, I love you.

00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:06.830
You love everyone, Reo.

00:20:06.830 --> 00:20:07.910
I can't deny that.

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:12.500
But that's what I love about you.

00:20:12.500 --> 00:20:13.830
Thanks!

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:19.040
"Midterm results"
"Thank you very much for your continued support.
We're announcing the midterm results.
We will continue looking forward to your support."

00:20:19.040 --> 00:20:20.950
"Popularity Ranking Midterm Results"
"1st Reo" "2nd Maki" "3rd Yuka" "4th Sorane"
"5th Yumeri" "6th Aya" "7th Maina"

00:20:22.410 --> 00:20:25.870
Sorane's in trouble.
She dropped from the top three.

00:20:25.870 --> 00:20:28.250
Dropped? Why?

00:20:28.250 --> 00:20:32.200
There was a sighting of her
walking with some guy in Wake.

00:20:32.200 --> 00:20:33.290
Wake?

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:36.040
So, wait. Sorane was near our place?

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:42.700
Come to think of it, maybe it wasn't
Sorane and her boyfriend,

00:20:42.700 --> 00:20:44.910
but rather you, Motoi, and Rena.

00:20:46.160 --> 00:20:49.080
I mean, Rena looks just like Sorane.

00:20:50.950 --> 00:20:53.330
I see! That's completely possible.

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:55.660
Right! That might be it!

00:20:55.660 --> 00:20:56.870
Really?

00:20:56.870 --> 00:20:59.080
It must've been a false alarm.

00:21:00.620 --> 00:21:02.040
Hooray!

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:03.790
Congrats, Motoi!

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:05.080
Thanks!

00:21:05.080 --> 00:21:07.000
Hopefully people realize it wasn't true!

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:09.330
--Hooray! Hooray!
--I was starting to feel bad for Sorane.

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:11.250
No, but wait...

00:21:11.250 --> 00:21:15.040
I think I'm the only Sorane stan
that knows the truth right now.

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:19.000
That means that I could be the one
who gives her a shoulder to cry on... right?

00:21:21.830 --> 00:21:23.700
That's really creepy...

00:21:31.200 --> 00:21:33.750
Peace! Peace, peace!

00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:36.950
No, you've got it all wrong!
You need to peace in a younger way!

00:21:36.950 --> 00:21:38.080
How about this?

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:41.080
I wonder what they're doing. It looks fun.

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:43.120
This is rather hard.

00:21:43.120 --> 00:21:45.700
Listen up. Your peace hands should be like this!

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:49.790
You need to take the angle
of an angel... No, a goddess!

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:52.450
Maina.

00:21:56.080 --> 00:21:59.120
Um... I, uh...

00:21:59.120 --> 00:22:00.700
I'll get it this time for sure!

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:04.660
Take that!

00:22:06.080 --> 00:22:08.450
Wh-What in the world was that pose?!

00:22:09.700 --> 00:22:11.330
It's Qigong!

00:22:11.330 --> 00:22:12.250
In that case...

00:22:12.250 --> 00:22:14.200
Hngh... You got me!

00:22:16.910 --> 00:22:18.370
It got through to her?

00:22:26.450 --> 00:22:28.500
What in the world?

00:22:28.500 --> 00:22:31.200
Maina's godly fan service...

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:33.450
Maybe you should be asking god for some help...

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:08.450
"Next episode preview"
Maina, you're super cute again today.

00:24:08.450 --> 00:24:11.330
Next time, it's going to be the
last day of the popularity voting.

00:24:11.330 --> 00:24:12.950
I'm studying for college entrance exams,

00:24:12.950 --> 00:24:15.870
so I'm sad that I can't vote
as much as everyone else.

00:24:15.870 --> 00:24:19.000
By the way, do I really look
that much like Sorane?

00:24:19.000 --> 00:24:20.000
"Run for Maina’s Sake"
Thank you very much!
